### Register an invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "debtor": "Jane Example",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

> {% client.global.set("invoiceId", response.body.id); %}

### Get the invoice just created
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### Invalid request -> 400 Problem Details
POST http://localhost:8080/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "debtor": "",
  "amount": -1,
  "currency": "euro"
}

### Unknown invoice -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
